        },
        "content": "Battery, load and electrical-output telemetry for the UniFi UPS devices. All values come directly from the controller and are shown per device where possible.\n\nGreen, amber and red indicate explicit status. Blue is quantitative emphasis. N/A means missing or unsupported data, never healthy zero.",
